# UI & Styling

## Design tokens (tailwind.config.js)
- Background: `black`, `black-2`, `green-deep`
- Brand: `green-mid`, `green-light`, `gold`, `gold-light`
- Glass: `glass-bg`, `glass-border`
- Fonts: `font-display` (Cormorant), `font-body` (Inter)
- Layout: `max-w-container`, `pt-nav` (76px navbar offset)

## Class merging
- Always use `cn()` from `@/lib/classes` for conditional classes

## Component choice
- **Forms, shop, admin**: use `@/components/ui` (`Button`, `Input`, `Table`, etc.)
- **Marketing sections**: may use `btnPrimary`, `btnGhost`, `glassCard`, `sectionTitle` from `@/lib/classes`
- Prefer migrating new interactive UI to `<Button>` over raw `btnPrimary` classes

## Prices & numbers
- Display prices with `formatPrice()` and `tabular-nums` / `numeric` class
- Currency is PKR (no decimals in formatter)

## Accessibility
- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label`
- Decorative icons: `aria-hidden="true"`
